  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s1",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Ms. ___ is an ___ female with a history of cerebral \npalsy (mostly aphasic, incontinent, bedbound), congenital \nhydrocephalus, syringomyelia and meningioma who presents with 2 \nepisodes of vomiting and unwillingness to take PO food/meds who \nwas found to have melena.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=5496-5763",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s2",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She was admitted to the medicine \nservice for evaluation of her GI bleed and underwent endoscopy \non ___.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=5764-5869",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "EGD showed significant friable esophagitis, which was \nthought to be the source of her bleeding.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=5870-5966",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s4",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "ACTIVE ISSUES",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=5968-5981",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s5",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "# UPPER GI BLEEDING: The GI service was consulted when she \narrived on the medicine floor and she was taken for endscopy on \nthe day of admission.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=5982-6128",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s6",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Given the results of her EGD, it was \nthought that her bleeding was most likely secondary to the \nesophagitis seen on the ___ EGD.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=6129-6259",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s7",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She was started on sucralfate \nand continued on pantoprazole for treatment of her esophagitis \nand her diet was advanced to full liquids.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=6260-6397",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s8",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Her hematocrit on the \nevening of the procedure remained stable at 33.1 (33.4 on \nadmission), but her HCT the ___ was 28.8.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=6398-6521",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s9",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She did not have \nfrank bleeding, but had not had any large bowel movements at \nthat time.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=6522-6612",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s10",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "A repeat HCT was ordered after 8 hours and ws 29.8.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=6613-6664",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s11",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Repeat ___ was 29.8 and on ___ was 31.2.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=6666-6706",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s13",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "# POOR PO INTAKE: Her poor PO intake is most likely the result \nof dysphagia secondary to her esophagitis.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=6850-6956",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s14",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She tolerated a full \nliquid diet well the evening of the procedure, but refused to \ntake her medications on the morning of ___.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=6957-7085",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s15",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She reported some \nnausea when a second attempt to given medications was made, so \nshe was given 4 mg of Zofran IV and she was able to take her \nmedications.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=7086-7243",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s16",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "On ___ she tolerated her medications well with slow \nadministration and sips of ginger ale.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=7244-7335",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s17",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "# URINARY TRACT INFECTION: Her WBC count on admission was \nelevated to 11.7.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=7337-7413",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s18",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "A urinalysis performed at that time showed 7",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=7414-7458",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s19",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "WBCs, many bacteria, and positive nitrites.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=7460-7503",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s20",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "A urine culture was \nsent.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=7504-7530",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s21",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "CXR performed on arrival was negative for any signs of \ninfection.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=7531-7597",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s22",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Given her allergies to penicillins and bactrim, and \nthe possible risk of lowering the seizure threshold with \nciprofloxacin, she was started on Nitrofurantoin 100 mg PO BID \nfor a 5 day course.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=7598-7792",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s23",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She remained afebrile throught her \nadmission.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=7793-7839",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s24",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "# HYPERTENSION: On arrival her blood pressure was 150-160 \nsystolic and her HR was around 100.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=7844-7938",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s25",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "She was continued on her \ndiltiazem, but it was converted to a short acting divided dose \nin case it was necessary to stop the medication in the event of \nhypotension from bleeding.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=7939-8120",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s26",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Her furosemide was held while she was",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=8121-8158",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s27",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "NPO for her procedure to prevent acute renal failure and was \nrestarted on discharge.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=14518535-DS-18:chars=8160-8245",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s28",
